class_name ActionNames
extends RefCounted
## The input actions in plain words, as the settings screen's Bindings list and its conflict help name them
## (menus.md §3 Rebinding, the table there). The front-sail keys say which sails they are for in the classes on
## disk (data_format.md §3.5: the slots are a class's front sails in file order). An action missing here falls
## back to its id in words ("camera_zoom_in" -> "Camera zoom in").

